  "description": "Cursed from childhood with the “Power of Iron,” Ianne can’t feel joy, pain, or love, until a sacred bracelet binds her to the fiery and dangerous Katharsid. To break the curse, she must confront emotions she’s never known, and the reluctant bond between them quickly sparks desire, jealousy, and secrets. In a world of sacred powers, mysterious attacks, and hidden agendas, Ianne and Katharsid must navigate their growing feelings… before their fates are decided by forces beyond their control.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
